{"id":"628181","name":"牡丹鲜花饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/628181/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牡丹花酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"熟花生","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"2g"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"110g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取200克面粉。","img":"images/628181/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放酵母。","img":"images/628181/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放温水。","img":"images/628181/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放熟油。","img":"images/628181/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成面团，放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/628181/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取100克面粉。","img":"images/628181/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放50克熟油。","img":"images/628181/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成团。","img":"images/628181/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"熟花生去壳去皮。","img":"images/628181/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捣碎。","img":"images/628181/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放碗里。","img":"images/628181/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取牡丹花酱。","img":"images/628181/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/628181/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"发好的面取出来。","img":"images/628181/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"揉光排气。","img":"images/628181/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"分成4份。","img":"images/628181/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"擀皮，把油皮也分4等份，放水油皮上。","img":"images/628181/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/628181/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"擀成牛舌饼。","img":"images/628181/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/628181/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"再从第一个如图折叠。","img":"images/628181/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"再擀牛舌饼。","img":"images/628181/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"卷起来，对切。","img":"images/628181/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/628181/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"用手指捏个窝窝。","img":"images/628181/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"放上馅料。","img":"images/628181/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/628181/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"擀成圆饼。","img":"images/628181/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"放烤盘里。","img":"images/628181/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"入烤箱，低温发酵15分钟取出来。","img":"images/628181/step_30.jpg"},{"step":31,"desc":"烤箱上下管170度预热好。","img":"images/628181/step_31.jpg"},{"step":32,"desc":"入烤箱烤15分钟，中间记得前后换个位置。","img":"images/628181/step_32.jpg"},{"step":33,"desc":"烤好的饼。","img":"images/628181/step_33.jpg"},{"step":34,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/628181/step_34.jpg"},{"step":35,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/628181/step_35.jpg"}],"tips":"我把油皮的油量减少了，所以成品不像买的那样的酥皮，但是还是好香哦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}